# The fixtures in this directory are exact wire bytes, not source files.
#
# They are compared member by member against what this build actually sends,
# including the JSON TYPE of every value, so any end-of-line or whitespace
# normalisation changes what is being compared. -text switches conversion off in
# both directions, so a checkout on a host with core.autocrlf=true gets the
# committed bytes rather than a CRLF rendering of them.
#
# README.md is deliberately not listed; it is an ordinary source file.
*.json -text
